{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H2、H15、H19、H53及候选 M6 足以支撑温柔、珍惜与坚定同时成立，所谓“近乎可以公开承认”表达的是内在坦然，并未新增真实的公开场景或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H12、H52、H53与候选 M47、M48共同支撑了身体卸力后暂时不必自保、余力随之向外涌出的局部心理过程，没有把音乐变化直接当作心理原因，也没有添加新的保证或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H20、H36、H37、H39、H53与候选 M39共同说明了身体松下来后失去感重新浮现、但快乐与安宁仍然成立的过程，没有否定此前的幸福或把音乐变化直接当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“顶端那记清亮、孤悬的和弦又把分散的感受一下收拢”把和弦的音乐变化直接写成心理整合的原因，越过了不得将音乐本身的变化当作心理原因的边界，尽管后续依据 H36、H37、H53 建立的心理解释本身成立。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都交代了可辨认的当下感受及其心理过程，并将温柔与坚定并存、身体卸力、失去感回返和重新肯定连成了可理解的脉络，不必依赖额外的听感记录才能读懂。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "97fd9573-55f6-45c4-b224-3c3ccf6f1652", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T184520322375Z", "elapsed_seconds": 210.047, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T18:48:50.379757+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1424905578db8f5e10d5e15def9c9904eec0bf615dfeff191ba88bc6688e2873", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false